refactor: P2 (Geometry/Interaction v3)

Geometry:
- typed Shape2D (rect/circle/ellipse/polygon) + pure containsPoint
- Spring2D (independent damped-spring simulation)
- ProceduralShape (params -> outline points); remove ProcShape/BezierShape
  (geometry + spring + color mixing + fake draw API)

Interaction:
- InteractionRegion + InteractionRouter; typed PointerInput + InteractionEvent
  (discriminated union emitted via a local Signal)
- engine-neutral pointerDown/pointerUp/pointerMove (no LÖVE mouse* naming)
- remove shape:string + bounds:number[] and on(event, any[]) protocols
